    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p> The tip of your opponent’s weapon neatly bisects the very end of your nose. You find this very upsetting.</p> <p><strong>Effects:</strong> You become so enraged you suffer a penalty of -10 to all Tests until the beginning of your next turn. Also, the resulting prominent scab lowers your Fellowship by -5 until it falls off in a week’s time.</p>"
